'' 'L[ i ]' over a STRING CONSTANT is its character code, as over a string variable -- a
'' tiko extension; fbc refuses it (error 3, 24). tiko took it as far as lowering and then
'' stopped the build on TKO0994. Narrow constants (plain, namespaced, concatenated,
'' typed 'as string'), any integer index, the NUL past the end, its address, and a
'' 'wstr' constant a wchar at a time (937 is the omega).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/const-string-index.tiko -o tests/codegen/conststringindex.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0994
'' RUN: tests/codegen/conststringindex.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 65677184
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 121           68            111           0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 71
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: TC
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: CGT
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 97            937           0
